	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「ねこ」フィギュアに「ジャケット」を着せ「ぶそう」パーツを装備させて楽しむ新感覚Hobby！",
			"• 第１弾に続き、ねこ造形作家として活躍中の森口修氏の原型により表情や毛並み、肉球など、細部に至るまで造形。",
			"• 第２弾のメカデザインは倉持キョーリュー氏が担当。動物型からマシン型へのシルエット変化の妙を発揮。",
			"• 「ぶそう」は単独でミニメカ状態にも組み替え可能。ジャケットや各ぶそうに搭載された3mmジョイントにより組み合わせは自由自在。",
			"• 複数組み合わせることで、さらに大きなねこぶそうに組み替えることができる。第１弾との組み合わせも可能。ユーザーの数だけニャスタマイズがある！",
			"• 〈てんこ盛り〉は一箱で全ての「ぶそう」がそろうまさに“てんこ盛り”なセット！",
			"• このセットでしか手に入らない新規造形ねこ「スコティッシュフォールド」と特別カラーの「ぶそう」に加えてボーナスパーツが入ったフルセット。"
		],
		"en": [
			"A new type of hobby where you can enjoy wearing a \"jacket\" on a \"cat\" figure and equipping it with \"buso\" parts!",
			"• Continuing from the first edition, every detail including facial expressions, fur, and paws has been sculpted using the prototype by Osamu Moriguchi, who is currently active as a cat sculptor.",
			"• Kyoryu Kuramochi is in charge of the second mechanical design. The silhouette changes from an animal shape to a machine shape.",
			"• \"Buso\" can be rearranged into a mini-mecha state by itself. You can freely combine them with the 3mm joints installed on the jacket and each bush.",
			"• By combining multiple pieces, you can make an even bigger catfish. Can also be combined with the first edition. There are as many customizations as there are users!",
			"• ``Tenkomori'' is a truly ``Tenkomori'' set that has all the ``Buso'' items in one box!",
			"• A full set that includes bonus parts in addition to the newly sculpted cat \"Scottish Fold\" and the special color \"Buso\" that can only be obtained with this set."
		]
	},
